Build integration
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
third_party/Directory.Build.props imports the repository-root Directory.Build.props (net10 / lock files) and then
turns OFF TreatWarningsAsErrors, analyzers and code-style enforcement for vendored sources only. MewStage's own
code lives outside third_party/ and keeps the strict standard.

third_party/MewUI.Consumer.targets (MewStage-authored) is imported at the end of every project that USES MewUI
(the demo executable, the UI test hosts; a library does not need it). It references the binding generator as an
analyzer and imports upstream's build/Aprillz.MewUI.Core.targets, which a ProjectReference does not carry: the
runtime feature switches (trimmed with ILLink.Substitutions.xml) and the interceptor namespace. MewStageUiHost =
Embedded turns DevTools, Hot Reload, managed file dialogs, touch gestures and MEWUI_*_DEBUG logging off;
MewStageUiHost = Tool keeps upstream's defaults.
